  "proof": "For any oddq ADDRESS-linear involution overFq, diagonalizable withnegativeaddressrankinteger r, the inducedVALUE permutation hastrace q^(2m-r)=N/q^r. Requiredspectatortrace N*(q^-a+q^-b-q^-(a+b)) liesstrictlybetweenN/q^b andN/q^(b-1) aftera>=b. No rankr canmatch. Products oflinearADDRESSselectors remainlinear; ifthefinaloperator isthis involution, thesametrace test applies.",
